[2026-11-18T10:59:04.774Z] [DEBUG] [client] MCP client request body, backend=safeoutputs, body={"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"create_pull_request","arguments":{"title":"[catalogue] Add MG MGU9 EV, Leapmotor B05 and Xpeng X9","branch":"catalogue/add-u9-b05-x9-2026-11-18","body":"Adds five entries for three EVs now sold in Australia and sets `updated` to 2026-11-18.\n\n| Change | Old → new | Source and exact figures |\n|---|---|---|\n| MG MGU9 EV (`mg-u9-ev-2026`) | none → added | MG Australia, mgmotor.com.au/vehicles/mgu9-ev: \"Available Now\", 102.2 kWh LFP, 430 km WLTP, 115 kW peak DC, 11 kW AC, 20-80% in 42 min. |\n| Leapmotor B05 Design LR and Style (`leapmotor-b05-design-2026`, `leapmotor-b05-style-2026`) | none → added | The Driven, 2 Jul 2026. Design LR: 67.1 kWh, 482 km, 174 kW, 30-80% about 18 min. Style: 56.2 kWh, 401 km, 30-80% about 16 min. Both 11 kW AC. Dealers due to receive cars late August; $35,990 / $39,990 launch offers. |\n| Xpeng X9 AWD Performance and Standard Range (`xpeng-x9-awd-2026`, `xpeng-x9-fwd-2026`) | none → added | The Driven, 21 Jul 2026. AWD: 110 kWh NCM, 580 km, up to 542 kW. Standard Range: 94.8 kWh LFP, 535 km, up to 542 kW. Both 10-80% in as little as 12 min, 11 kW AC. Priced from $89,900 and $109,900 plus on-roads, orders open. |\n\n**Not sure about:**\n- **MGU9 EV price:** MG's page shows no price (it sits behind Build & Price). I added it because the page says \"Available Now\". The type2 plug is assumed, as the page names only CCS2.\n- **Leapmotor B05 Style peak DC:** The Driven says 174 kW for both variants, but other reports say 156 kW for the Style. I used the lower figure. Leapmotor's Australian site could not be fetched (certificate error).\n- **Xpeng X9 542 kW:** this comes from The Driven (and agrees with a search summary of Zecar). I couldn't open Xpeng's own Australian page (certificate error), so it is worth checking.\n- **Not added, Deepal E07:** Deepal's page gives 240 kW, 89.98 kWh, 550 km RWD and 510 km AWD, and says test drives are available. It shows no price (\"From XX,XXX RDP\"), so it stays a candidate.\n- **Chery, HQ and Avatr:** not researched this run.\n- **Scope of this run:** I did not complete the 12-make re-check of existing entries, so no make is marked as re-checked in memory."},"_meta":{"claudecode/toolUseId":"toolu_019pUsdNtqeLyzaBVBkW1QYk","progressToken":2}},"jsonrpc":"2.0","id":2}
