d this run.\n- **Scope of this run:** I did not complete the 12-make re-check of existing entries, so no make is marked as re-checked in memory.","branch":"catalogue/add-u9-b05-x9-2026-11-18","title":"[catalogue] Add MG MGU9 EV, Leapmotor B05 and Xpeng X9"}
